From eee28bc5c5da5ac5c5560645bd4fe92659627d6a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 01:49:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Daily check-in: easy to find in the Journal afterwards

After Check-in the sheet now says 'Saved to your Journal' with Open
Journal (Progress, Journal tab, via /wellness?tab=journal) and Done.
The Journal tab is on Progress in every version, not only v4+, and v5's
own journal on Your goals lists the daily check-ins too (also when no
session has been built yet).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
